  "claim": "The voice actress in the animated film Alpha and Omega voiced the character  Kairi in the video game series \"Kingdom Hearts\".",
  "evidencia": "Page: Alpha and Omega (film series). Sentence: The first film was released in 2010 and featured the voices of Justin Long and Hayden Panettiere, though subsequent movies were direct-to-video and therefore featured a smaller cast, primarily Ben Diskin and Kate Higgins.\nPage: Hayden Panettiere. Sentence: She is known for her roles as cheerleader Claire Bennet on the NBC sci-fi series \"Heroes\" (2006–10), Juliette Barnes in the ABC/CMT musical-drama series \"Nashville\" (2012–present) and Kairi in the video game series \"Kingdom Hearts\".",
