        "original_id": "fa2df367-b34b-51cb-951b-b3a667e8d055",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hayden Panettiere, Justin Long, Ben Diskin, Kate Higgins\n- Products: Alpha and Omega film series, Heroes, Nashville, Kingdom Hearts\n- Companies: NBC, ABC, CMT\n\nFacts:\n- The first Alpha and Omega film was released in 2010 and featured the voices of Justin Long and Hayden Panettiere.\n- Subsequent Alpha and Omega movies were released direct-to-video and primarily featured Ben Diskin and Kate Higgins in a smaller cast.\n- Hayden Panettiere is known for playing Claire Bennet on NBC's sci-fi series Heroes from 2006 to 2010.\n- Hayden Panettiere is known for voicing Kairi in the Kingdom Hearts video game series.\n- Hayden Panettiere is known for playing Juliette Barnes in the ABC/CMT musical-drama series Nashville from 2012 onward.",
